<</Type/StructElem/S/Figure/P 1305 0 R/Alt(Corruption ablation on TinyStories, both generator seeds (circles: seed 0, squares: seed 1), one frozen codec. (a) Clean teacher-forced code cross-entropy of the MLX NCM; the Released TinyStories checkpoint (Kumbong et al.) uses a different codec. (b) GPT-2 large generative perplexity on a logarithmic axis: the five sampling-seed values of each model as small points and their mean as the marker, with horizontal lines for the MLX AR baseline (seeds 0 and 1), the Released TinyStories checkpoint and held-out text. Lower clean loss goes with worse free-running text. The two panels use different measures and are not on a shared axis.)/A[<</O/Layout/Placement/Block>>]/K[0]/Pg 2206 0 R>>
